  "id": "t2-secant-v2",
  "mechanism_class": "structural",
  "mechanism_rationale": "In t2-secant-v1 (readout-2d0a1240650dbb7b14eb74d1), macro transport chords canceled symmetric flanks around modes in 1D/2D (gaussian1d_smoke std_ratio=1.398) while 1D chord secants in 170D suffered a 1/sqrt(170) concentration-of-measure projection loss on five_word_joint_smoke (modes=2/5, critic grad norm 2.45 > 1.0), and finite-difference subtraction across ReLU kinks introduced parameter-Jacobian impulses. Propagating one deterministic orthonormal-frame tangent per sample via forward-mode AD (dual_level) evaluates directional derivatives at the exact primal activation gates (0 kink discontinuity, 0 autograd.grad, 0 create_graph=True) and reconstructs ||nabla_x D||_2 across spatial basis-slot neighbors, while BF16 image critics retain live-endpoint reuse + separable Rademacher micro-secants and 8x8 pooled Chamfer scale tracking to break 100 ms/step on dcgan_performance_r256.",
